<section class="_s6">
 <div class="_s6-hdr">
 <span class="_s6-ey">Premium quality</span>
 <h2 class="_s6-h2">What makes Northfinder<br><span class="_s6-red">premium?</span></h2>
 <p class="_s6-body">Premium is not just about price. It is about materials, functionality, craftsmanship and details that make sense in the mountains – season after season.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="_s6-cards"><div class="_s6-card"><div class="_s6-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 3h12l4 6-10 13L2 9z"/><path d="M11 3 8 9l4 13 4-13-3-6"/><path d="M2 9h20"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="_s6-clabel">Top-tier materials</h3><p class="_s6-cdesc">We use proven performance materials and technologies such as PrimaLoft®, Polartec®, Pertex® and Vibram.</p></div></div><div class="_s6-card"><div class="_s6-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m8 3 4 8 5-5 5 15H2L8 3z"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="_s6-clabel">Tested in the mountains</h3><p class="_s6-cdesc">We develop and test our products in real conditions. That is how we know how they behave in motion, in cold, wind and bad weather.</p></div></div><div class="_s6-card"><div class="_s6-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21.3 8.7 8.7 21.3a1 1 0 0 1-1.4 0l-4.6-4.6a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.4L15.3 2.7a1 1 0 0 1 1.4 0l4.6 4.6a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.4Z"/><path d="m7.5 10.5 2 2"/><path d="m10.5 7.5 2 2"/><path d="m13.5 4.5 2 2"/><path d="m4.5 13.5 2 2"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="_s6-clabel">Thought-through construction</h3><p class="_s6-cdesc">We adapt the cut, the layering of materials and the placement of functional elements to the way the body really moves outdoors.</p></div></div><div class="_s6-card"><div class="_s6-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 21v-7"/><path d="M4 10V3"/><path d="M12 21v-9"/><path d="M12 8V3"/><path d="M20 21v-5"/><path d="M20 12V3"/><path d="M1 14h6"/><path d="M9 8h6"/><path d="M17 16h6"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="_s6-clabel">Functional details</h3><p class="_s6-cdesc">From ventilation and pocket placement to hoods, zippers and reinforced areas. Every detail has a reason.</p></div></div><div class="_s6-card"><div class="_s6-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="_s6-clabel">Design that lasts</h3><p class="_s6-cdesc">We combine functionality with a clean, timeless design that is not built on short-lived trends.</p></div></div><div class="_s6-card"><div class="_s6-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="_s6-clabel">Longer lifespan</h3><p class="_s6-cdesc">We choose durable materials and construction solutions so that our products serve reliably for as long as possible.</p></div></div><div class="_s6-card"><div class="_s6-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><path d="M12 13a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6z"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="_s6-clabel">Carpathian origin</h3><p class="_s6-cdesc">Northfinder was born in Slovakia. The Carpathians are our natural environment for developing, testing and everyday use of outdoor clothing.</p></div></div><div class="_s6-card"><div class="_s6-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10z"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="_s6-clabel">Sustainability</h3><p class="_s6-cdesc">Recycled fibres, PFC-free materials and more responsible production processes. Performance with respect for the nature we use it in.</p></div></div></div>
</section>
